{"seq":2,"slug":"bundle-price-discount-allocate","title":"组合定价与折扣分摊到组件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/product-bundle-kit-engineering/bundle-availability-price/bundle-price-discount-allocate","wordCount":2323,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"组合定价与折扣分摊到组件\">组合定价与折扣分摊到组件</h1><p>组合的成交价与组件标价之和之间的差额，就是折扣。这个差额不能只记在组合行上——它必须被分摊到每个组件，因为退税、退款、成本核算、供应商结算、以及跨境的关税完税价格都以组件为单位。分摊算法的目标不是「算得快」，而是三条可验证的性质：<strong>分尽</strong>（各组件分摊额之和严格等于组合价）、<strong>可复核</strong>（任何人用同一份输入能算出同一结果）、<strong>单调</strong>（组件的分摊额不超过它的标价）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-定价模式的三种形态\">核心概念：定价模式的三种形态</h2><p>组合价格有三种来源，它们的分摊含义不同。</p>\n<p><strong>固定组合价（fixed bundle price）</strong>：运营直接给组合一个价，例如「三件套 ¥299」。折扣总额 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D = \\sum_i p_i - P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>，可能是正（优惠）也可能是负（组合比单买更贵，通常应被拒绝）。</p>\n<p><strong>折扣率价（percentage off）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P = (1 - r) \\sum_i p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p><strong>组件覆盖价（component override）</strong>：部分组件按原价计，其余组件分享剩余价格。例如「主机按 ¥4200，配件部分固定 ¥100」，此时配件组的折扣按它们在配件组内的标价比例分摊。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>公式</th>\n<th>折扣基</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>固定组合价</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D = \\sum p_i - P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>标价之和</td>\n<td>套装促销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>折扣率价</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D = r \\sum p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>标价之和</td>\n<td>满折、会员价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>组件覆盖价</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></msub><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_j = \\sum_{i \\in G_j} p_i - P_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.247em;vertical-align:-0.497em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1786em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.497em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>组内标价之和</td>\n<td>主机 + 配件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三种形态可以用同一套分摊算法处理，区别只在「先分组求折扣，再组内分摊」，所以实现上应把分摊函数写成「给定一组组件的标价向量与目标总额，返回分摊向量」，三种模式都退化成对它的调用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分摊算法-比例法-取整与余额\">分摊算法：比例法、取整与余额</h2><p>最直觉的做法是按标价比例分摊：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_i = \\frac{p_i}{\\sum_j p_j} \\cdot P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2294em;vertical-align:-1.1218em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1218em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>问题在于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 通常不是整数分。四舍五入后求和往往与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 差几分钱。这几分钱在单笔订单上无关紧要，但在百万笔订单的税务申报里就是一笔对不平的账。因此分摊必须有一个<strong>确定性取整 + 余额分配</strong>的收尾步骤。</p>\n<p>标准做法是<strong>最大余数法</strong>（largest remainder method，也叫 Hare quota）：先取每个组件分摊额的整数部分，把剩余的分（余额 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>−</mo><mo>∑</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R = P - \\sum \\lfloor \\cdot \\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mopen\">⌊</span><span class=\"mord\">⋅</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌋</span></span></span></span></span>）按小数部分从大到小依次分配，小数部分相同时按组件 ID 稳定排序打破平局。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"function apportion(prices[], total, scale = 100):&#10;    # prices 与 total 均为最小货币单位 (分) 的整数&#10;    S = sum(prices)&#10;    if S == 0: return zeros(len(prices))&#10;    raw   = [p * total / S for p in prices]        # 有理数, 不取整&#10;    floor = [r // 1 for r in raw]&#10;    rem   = total - sum(floor)                     # 余额, 0 &lt;= rem &lt; n&#10;    order = sort_by(desc(r - floor[r])), tie_break = index asc&#10;    for k in 0..rem-1: floor[order[k]] += 1&#10;    assert sum(floor) == total                     # 分尽不变量&#10;    return floor\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function apportion(prices[], total, scale = 100):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    # prices 与 total 均为最小货币单位 (分) 的整数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    S = sum(prices)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if S == 0: return zeros(len(prices))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    raw   = [p * total / S for p in prices]        # 有理数, 不取整</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    floor = [r // 1 for r in raw]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    rem   = total - sum(floor)                     # 余额, 0 &#x3C;= rem &#x3C; n</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    order = sort_by(desc(r - floor[r])), tie_break = index asc</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for k in 0..rem-1: floor[order[k]] += 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    assert sum(floor) == total                     # 分尽不变量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return floor</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这段伪代码里有三个必须保留的性质。<code>scale = 100</code> 表示所有金额以分为单位用整数运算，浮点数在分摊里会产生不可复现的尾差。<code>tie_break = index asc</code> 保证同样的输入永远得到同样的输出——没有稳定打破平局，同一笔订单在两次计算中可能得到不同分摊，这对账时无法复现。最后一行 <code>assert</code> 不是装饰，它是运行时的分尽守卫，应当在测试环境中开启（生产环境可降级为告警，因为异常中止订单创建比一笔尾差更糟）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"为什么不用-最后一组分摊余额\">为什么不用「最后一组分摊余额」</h3><p>一个常见的简化是「前面组件按四舍五入，最后一个组件吃掉所有余额」。它满足分尽，但违反单调性与可复核性：最后一个组件的分摊额可能超过它的标价（当其它组件都被向上取整时），也可能出现负值（当余额为负）。最大余数法把余额打散到多个组件，单次调整最多 1 分，因此超越标价的风险被大幅降低，且更容易用一条断言守卫。</p>\n<h3 id=\"单件退款的敏感度\">单件退款的敏感度</h3><p>分摊的取整方式会直接影响退款金额。假设组合价 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100.00</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P = 100.00</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100.00</span></span></span></span></span>，两个组件标价 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60.00</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">60.00</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60.00</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>40.00</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">40.00</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40.00</span></span></span></span></span>，按比例应分得 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60.00</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">60.00</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60.00</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>40.00</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">40.00</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40.00</span></span></span></span></span>，无尾差。但如果 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>99.99</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P = 99.99</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">99.99</span></span></span></span></span>，理论值是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>59.994</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">59.994</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">59.994</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>39.996</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">39.996</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">39.996</span></span></span></span></span>，最大余数法给 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>5999</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>4000</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[5999, 4000]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">5999</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4000</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 还是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>6000</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3999</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[6000, 3999]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">6000</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3999</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 取决于小数部分——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.994</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0.996</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.994 &gt; 0.996</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6835em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.994</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.996</span></span></span></span></span> 不成立，所以先给第二个组件，结果是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>5999</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>4000</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[5999, 4000]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">5999</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4000</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>。退第一个组件时退 59.99，退第二个时退 40.00，这与「按标价比例」的直觉一致。换一种取整方式可能给出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>6000</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3999</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[6000, 3999]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">6000</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3999</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，此时退第一个组件会退给它 60.00——比它应得的更多，且总额超过组合价。这就是为什么取整规则必须写进文档并被测试覆盖（见 <a href=\"../bundle-aftersales-ops/bundle-refund-apportion\">退款按分摊金额回算</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分摊基数-标价还是售价\">分摊基数：标价还是售价</h2><p>分摊的「基数」选什么，决定了分摊结果。三种常见选择各有明确的适用场景。</p>\n<p>**按标价（list price）**分摊：最直观，组件间的相对价值保持稳定。缺点是当某个组件本身已在打折（清仓）时，它在组合里仍按原标价占份额，会把折扣更多地分给其它组件。</p>\n<p>**按当前售价（current selling price）**分摊：反映真实价值，但组件售价会随时间变动，历史订单的分摊无法复现——所以只能用于下单时计算并快照，不能用于事后重算。</p>\n<p><strong>按成本（cost）加成</strong>分摊：让每个组件的毛利率大致相同，适合成本核算，但成本是内部数据，不能用于对客展示。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>基数</th>\n<th>可复现性</th>\n<th>对客合理性</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>标价</td>\n<td>高（标价变动有记录）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>对客展示与退款</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>当前售价</td>\n<td>低（需快照）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>下单瞬间计算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本</td>\n<td>中（成本有版本）</td>\n<td>不适用</td>\n<td>内部毛利核算</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>工程上的结论是：<strong>分摊要算两次</strong>。对客分摊用标价（并在订单里快照），内部毛利分摊用成本。把两者混成一个字段，会在「成本重估」时让历史订单的对客分摊莫名其妙地变化。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE order_item_component (&#10;  order_id      VARCHAR(32) NOT NULL,&#10;  component_seq INT         NOT NULL,&#10;  sku_id        VARCHAR(32) NOT NULL,&#10;  qty           INT         NOT NULL,&#10;  list_price    INT         NOT NULL,   -- 分, 分摊基数&#10;  allocated_amt INT         NOT NULL,   -- 分, 分尽后结果&#10;  cost_basis    INT         NULL,       -- 分, 内部毛利用, 不对客&#10;  rounding_bps  SMALLINT    NULL,       -- 记录本轮取整方向, 便于审计&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (order_id, component_seq),&#10;  CONSTRAINT chk_alloc_nonneg CHECK (allocated_amt &gt;= 0),&#10;  CONSTRAINT chk_alloc_le_list CHECK (allocated_amt &lt;= list_price)&#10;) ENGINE=InnoDB;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> order_item_component</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  order_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  component_seq </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sku_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  qty           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  list_price    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 分, 分摊基数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  allocated_amt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 分, 分尽后结果</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  cost_basis    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 分, 内部毛利用, 不对客</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rounding_bps  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SMALLINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 记录本轮取整方向, 便于审计</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (order_id, component_seq),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> chk_alloc_nonneg </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (allocated_amt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> chk_alloc_le_list </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (allocated_amt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> list_price)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) ENGINE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">InnoDB;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>chk_alloc_le_list</code> 这条约束是单调性的数据库级守卫。它能拦住分摊额超越标价的情形，这是最容易被消费者投诉的偏差——「我退这一件拿到手的比它标价还多」会立刻引发对定价的信任问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多级组合的分摊顺序\">多级组合的分摊顺序</h2><p>嵌套组合（组合含组合）的分摊必须<strong>自上而下</strong>逐层分摊，不能一次性摊到叶子。原因是每一层的价格可能是独立设定的：外层组合有组合价，内层子组合也有自己的组合价，两层折扣率不同。正确顺序是外层组合价先分摊到「内层子组合 + 其它组件」，然后内层子组合按它自己的价格分摊到它的组件。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[外层组合价 P_out] --&gt; B[分摊到 [子组合 P_in, 组件C]&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[子组合分得 A_in]&#10;    B --&gt; D[组件C 分得 A_c]&#10;    C --&gt; E[&quot;按 P_in 分摊到子组件1,2&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[子组件1 分得 a1]&#10;    E --&gt; G[子组件2 分得 a2]&#10;    F --&gt; H[&quot;校验: a1+a2+A_c = P_out&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; H\">graph TD\n    A[外层组合价 P_out] --&gt; B[分摊到 [子组合 P_in, 组件C]\"]\n    B --&gt; C[子组合分得 A_in]\n    B --&gt; D[组件C 分得 A_c]\n    C --&gt; E[\"按 P_in 分摊到子组件1,2\"]\n    E --&gt; F[子组件1 分得 a1]\n    E --&gt; G[子组件2 分得 a2]\n    F --&gt; H[\"校验: a1+a2+A_c = P_out\"]\n    G --&gt; H</pre><p>漏掉逐层分摊（直接把外层价按叶子标价一次性摊）会得到一个看似合理的错值——因为内层子组合的折扣率与外层不同，一次摊平等于假设所有层级折扣率相同，这在「外层满减、内层另设组合价」时就不成立。</p>\n<h3 id=\"每层都要独立分尽\">每层都要独立分尽</h3><p>逐层分摊的每一层都必须独立满足分尽不变量，而不是只在最外层检查。这里的理由是<strong>部分退货发生在任意层</strong>：消费者可能只退内层子组合里的一个组件，此时系统需要知道该组件的分摊额，而这个值只有在内层完成了一次完整分摊时才有定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"折扣为负与组合倒挂\">折扣为负与组合倒挂</h2><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum p_i &lt; P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 时折扣为负，组合比单买更贵。这在配置错误时会出现（运营改了组件价格但没改组合价）。工程上有三种处理：拒绝保存、自动按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 定价、允许但给运营告警。</p>\n<p>推荐在<strong>保存时校验并告警，运行时按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max(P, 0)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 正常分摊</strong>——即允许负折扣被分摊（各组件分摊额大于标价），但要在运营后台显著提示。理由是某些场景下组合更贵是合理的（含服务的组合），不该被系统硬性禁止。但此时 <code>chk_alloc_le_list</code> 约束会被违反，所以<strong>这条约束的适用范围是「折扣非负」的组合</strong>，模型上应有一个字段区分两类，让约束只作用于其中一类。</p>\n<h3 id=\"组件价格变动后的历史分摊\">组件价格变动后的历史分摊</h3><p>组件标价会随时间变动。历史订单的分摊额已经快照，不应随标价变化重算——这正是把 <code>list_price</code> 冗余在订单组件行上的原因。如果实现上依赖实时 JOIN 组件表取标价，那么一次调价会让历史订单的分摊凭空改变，退货时退出的金额与当初收到的分摊不符，这是对账差异的经典来源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>组合折扣必须分摊到组件，因为退税、退款、成本核算、结算都以组件为单位；三种定价模式可归一到同一套「按比例 + 最大余数取整」算法。</li>\n<li>分摊的三条可验证性质是分尽、可复核、单调；最大余数法加稳定打破平局同时满足三者，最后一组吃余额的做法不满足后两者。</li>\n<li>分摊基数应选标价（对客、可复现），内部毛利另算一套成本基数分摊，两者不能混成一个字段。</li>\n<li>嵌套组合必须逐层分摊，每层独立分尽，因为部分退货可能发生在任意层。</li>\n<li>折扣为负时应告警而非硬拒，并让「分摊不超过标价」的约束只作用于折扣非负的组合。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"组合定价与折扣分摊到组件","id":"组合定价与折扣分摊到组件"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：定价模式的三种形态","id":"核心概念-定价模式的三种形态"},{"level":2,"text":"分摊算法：比例法、取整与余额","id":"分摊算法-比例法-取整与余额"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么不用「最后一组分摊余额」","id":"为什么不用-最后一组分摊余额"},{"level":3,"text":"单件退款的敏感度","id":"单件退款的敏感度"},{"level":2,"text":"分摊基数：标价还是售价","id":"分摊基数-标价还是售价"},{"level":2,"text":"多级组合的分摊顺序","id":"多级组合的分摊顺序"},{"level":3,"text":"每层都要独立分尽","id":"每层都要独立分尽"},{"level":2,"text":"折扣为负与组合倒挂","id":"折扣为负与组合倒挂"},{"level":3,"text":"组件价格变动后的历史分摊","id":"组件价格变动后的历史分摊"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"按组件计算组合可售量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/product-bundle-kit-engineering/bundle-availability-price/bundle-available-compute"},"next":{"title":"组合与优惠券 / 活动的叠加规则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/product-bundle-kit-engineering/bundle-availability-price/bundle-promo-interaction"}}